1
00:00:00,086 --> 00:00:02,586
Fighting
and cutting school…

2
00:00:04,095 --> 00:00:04,945
Listen

3
00:00:05,028 --> 00:00:07,141
I've been teaching
for 20 years

4
00:00:07,647 --> 00:00:10,345
and I still can't
get used to you guys

5
00:00:13,891 --> 00:00:15,155
Can anyone reach them?

6
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:17,910
Huh?

7
00:00:35,182 --> 00:00:36,182
Hyeon-wu!

8
00:00:38,099 --> 00:00:39,099
Lee Hyeon-wu!

9
00:01:00,770 --> 00:01:02,030
Hey, Il-tak

10
00:01:03,146 --> 00:01:05,849
Let's talk for a minute

11
00:01:08,868 --> 00:01:10,445
Don't be like that

12
00:01:10,815 --> 00:01:11,815
We're still friends

13
00:01:12,281 --> 00:01:13,281
I…

14
00:01:14,616 --> 00:01:16,382
have never
thought of you…

15
00:01:17,466 --> 00:01:18,466
as a friend
